{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02139",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.38,
      "end_seconds": 4.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.98,
      "end_seconds": 9.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Right, not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.81,
      "end_seconds": 26.34,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "mainly a nosebleed that won't stop. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.59,
      "end_seconds": 30.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.53,
      "end_seconds": 34.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "About... well, three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.06,
      "end_seconds": 41.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.2,
      "end_seconds": 55.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.54,
      "text": "Pinching helps a bit. It's worse with blowing the nose. Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.55,
      "end_seconds": 58.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Have you been feeling lightheaded?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.21,
      "end_seconds": 63.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Yeah, I've had that since last night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.46,
      "end_seconds": 67.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "how much does it it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.87,
      "end_seconds": 71.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "So, it feels mild to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.23,
      "end_seconds": 95.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "let me check a few things. Any head injury, chest pain or easy bruising?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.71,
      "end_seconds": 98.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.14,
      "end_seconds": 102.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.22,
      "end_seconds": 105.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.37,
      "end_seconds": 121.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.34,
      "end_seconds": 128.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I'm on a blood thinner, 5 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.82,
      "end_seconds": 132.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.71,
      "end_seconds": 134.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.55,
      "end_seconds": 156.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.1,
      "end_seconds": 167.7,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. My partner and our baby. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.2,
      "end_seconds": 173.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.78,
      "end_seconds": 175.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "no, no conditions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.67,
      "end_seconds": 180.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.59,
      "end_seconds": 184.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.52,
      "end_seconds": 202.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.45,
      "end_seconds": 209.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Not currently, but as a youngster erythromycin gave me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.5,
      "end_seconds": 214.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.25,
      "end_seconds": 227.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "So, nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.57,
      "end_seconds": 252.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.7 degrees, pulse is 66 beats a minute, BP is 114 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.22,
      "end_seconds": 256.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "hmm, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.95,
      "end_seconds": 260.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.28,
      "end_seconds": 265.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.04,
      "end_seconds": 269.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Right, nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.06,
      "end_seconds": 284.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "There is a bleeding point on the front of the septum and the nose has been dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.81,
      "end_seconds": 299.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.55,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. So where does that leave us? It fits best with an anterior nosebleed on a blood thinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.05,
      "end_seconds": 303.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.35,
      "end_seconds": 325.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.19,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an anterior nosebleed on a blood thinner. Lean forward and pinch the soft part of the nose for fifteen minutes; I will cauterise the point. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.74,
      "end_seconds": 330.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "right, I'll do that thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.67,
      "end_seconds": 333.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
}